		{
			description: [
				"There is still time to tend the crops, decorate the kitchen, and watch the seasons turn. &6Sunlit Valley Expanded&r gives you more reasons to pack a bag and leave that comfortable home behind."
				""
				"The pages in this section follow the additions to Society: new ways to prepare food, refine resources, practice magic, and seek out dangerous encounters. Choose a craft that interests you and follow its trail."
				""
				"&cRead Death's Due before your first expedition.&r Preparation matters here, and coming home empty-handed is not the worst that can happen."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:compass"
			id: "449AF2706F794D89"
			subtitle: "A comfortable home is only the beginning."
			tasks: [{
				id: "2BADAF809AB3973B"
				title: "Let's see what lies beyond the farm."
