			description: [
				"Open the &6Death's Due&r page in this section. Learn how Guild enrollment, recovery claims, and lost experience work before risking your favorite tools."
				""
				"Keep food, spare equipment, and money for recovery at home. A successful expedition ends with you bringing its discoveries back."
			]
